        "title": "beware the guides",
        "text": "You can't really enter the main temple, unless you're hindu, but the surrounding grounds are very interesting places, especially the cremation site. Beware of the the monkeys, whose bites can be dangerous. Also beware of all the \"guides\", who are happy to walk you around and then ask a large fee at the end. Best to bargain the price at the beginning or refuse right away. The park on top is very nice and quiet and it leads to the north-east gate, from where a 30mins walk will lead you to the Bodhnath Stupa.",
